							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1006.msg9980#msg9980"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1006.msg9980#msg9980">Re: Sys...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> August 11, 2004, 04:47:42 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Bah I went through about a dozen or more typhoons during my 3 years in Okinawa.&nbsp; They are kinda fun
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
