								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I have family in South Florida&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm31.gif" alt="cwm31" border="0" /> I really hope this is not to devestating. I lived there when Andrew hit and we lost our house, hell we lost the whole neighborhood we lived in. Owners had a meeting and decided it would just be better to bulldoze everything and sell the land.
